# 2026-07-06 webhook body vs. headers

## What I was trying to do
I was trying to find the data that the webhook had received through the site.
## What broke
The form submission reached the webhook and n8n showed "1 item," green check. This looked like it had worked to me. But I couldn't find the name/email/message in the output, instead it was showing me host, user-agent, and other Cloudflare stuff instead.
## What I thought was wrong
I thought that the data didn't go through and that the production URL that n8n gave me failed. 
## What was actually wrong
The data I was looking for was in the request *body*, and the table view was showing the *headers*.
## How I found it
I Switched to JSON view
## Takeaway
Each request has envelopes (headers) and a letter (body). The data I am looking for is usually in the body.
